---
title: Champagne Cocktail
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, sparkling]
source: Classic cocktail, number 42 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Put a @sugar cube{1} in a #champagne flute{} and soak it with @Angostura bitters{3%dashes}. Pour in @champagne{4%fl_oz} slowly. Twist a @lemon peel{1%twist} over the glass and drop it in.

> Some specs add a quarter ounce of cognac before the wine.
